Fast offline launches

Bound TCP connects of the CLI and service HTTP clients to 10 seconds, so an
unreachable Microsoft is detected in seconds and the stored offline license
takes over at once; skip the PlayFab authorisation attempt when the launch
already runs on that stored license. No overall request timeout is added:
the same client streams game data.

